@baseUrl = http://localhost:4010

### a cacheable single resource returns a strong ETag
# @captureHeader etag = ETag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee

### the client already has this version: 304, no body
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee
If-None-Match: {{etag}}

### collections are private and not stored
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2

### the same product in another tenant has its own representation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_globex/products/prd_eu_mug

### Authorization is part of the cache key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee
Authorization: Bearer tok_acme_admin
